request.description:
Updates the status and/or note of a specific NDVI change point.

Request body:
{
  "table_name": "2025-11-01_Dahod_SF_NDVI_Change",  // required
  "pixel_id": "456",                                  // required
  "status": "Resolved",                               // optional: Pending | Under Review | Resolved | False Positive
  "note": "Verified on site"                          // optional: action taken / notes
}

If the status or note column doesn't exist on the NDVI Change table, it will be added automatically.

Response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Status updated successfully",
  "data": {
    "pixel_id": "456",
    "status": "Resolved",
    "note": "Verified on site"
  }
}

Lists all NDVI Change table names in the database.

Response:
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    "2025-11-01_Dahod_SF_NDVI_Change",
    "2025-11-01_Bharuch_Sub_Division_NDVI_Change"
  ]
}
